<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #333;
      } .container { width: 100%; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px
      solid #ddd; border-radius: 5px; overflow: hidden; } .header_image {
      display: flex; justify-content:center; width: 100%; } .header_image_logo {
      margin: 0 auto; width: 120px; } .header { background-color:#ffd400; color:
      #092648; padding: 15px; text-align: center; font-size: 24px; } .content {
      padding: 20px; } .footer { padding: 15px; text-align: center;
      background-color: #f1f1f1; font-size: 12px; } .highlight { font-weight:
      bold; color: black; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header_image">
        <img
          class="header_image_logo"
          src="cid:logo"
          width="120px"
          alt="Logo"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="header">We have received your application</div>
      <div class="content">
        <p>Dear {{coachName}}</p>
        <p>
          Thank you for your interest in being a chess coach at We Chess.
        </p>
        <p>Your application is being reviewed.</p>
        <p>We will be back to you within the next 2 working days.</p>
        <br />
        <p>With best regards</p>
        <p>We Chess Team</p>
        <br />
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>
          We Chess Software
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>